    {
      "source": "Interface used to indicate that a bean should <em>run</em> when it is contained within\na <a href=\"SpringApplication.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot\"><code>SpringApplication</code></a>. Multiple <a href=\"ApplicationRunner.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot\"><code>ApplicationRunner</code></a> beans can be defined\nwithin the same application context and can be ordered using the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/Ordered.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core\"><code>Ordered</code></a>\ninterface or <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/annotation/Order.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.annotation\"><code>@Order</code></a> annotation.",
      "translation": "用于指示当 Bean 包含在 <a href=\"SpringApplication.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot\"><code>SpringApplication</code></a> 中时应<em>运行</em>的接口。可以在同一应用程序上下文中定义多个 <a href=\"ApplicationRunner.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot\"><code>ApplicationRunner</code></a> Bean，并使用 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/Ordered.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core\"><code>Ordered</code></a> 接口或 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/annotation/Order.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.annotation\"><code>@Order</code></a> 注解对其进行排序。",
      "count": 2
